      "content": "Based on a review of the geological and environmental summaries, the primary long-term structural risks appear to center around coastal erosion vulnerability due to sea-level rise projections. There are also noted concerns regarding the stability of the subterranean limestone bedrock under heavy, prolonged development loads. These factors, if not meticulously mitigated through engineering solutions, could pose significant and costly risks over the project's lifespan.",
